== fx.delay "Stereo Delay" finder="Stereo Delay" Effect
in   In L               Audio    ConnectionOnly       inline=true  port
in   In R               Audio    ConnectionOnly       inline=true  port
in   Time               Control  ConnectionOrConstant inline=true  num 500 [1..2000] ms log
in   Feedback           Control  ConnectionOrConstant inline=true  num 0.5 [0..1] %
in   Mix                Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 0.5 [0..1] %
in   High Cut           Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 10000 [100..20000] Hz log
in   Low Cut            Control  ConstantOnly         inline=false num 20 [20..2000] Hz log
in   Ping-Pong          Control  ConstantOnly         inline=true  toggle false "P-P"
in   Sync               Control  ConstantOnly         inline=true  select 0 ["Off", "1/4", "1/8", "1/8T", "1/16", "1/16T", "1/32", "1/4D", "1/8D"] "Sync"
in   Tape               Control  ConstantOnly         inline=true  toggle false "Tape"
out  Out L              Audio
out  Out R              Audio
knob Time               "Time" Modulatable
knob Feedback           "FB" Modulatable
knob Mix                "Mix" KnobOnly
knob High Cut           "HiCut" KnobOnly
knob Low Cut            "LoCut" KnobOnly

