out  Out                Audio
out  GR                 Control
knob Threshold          "Thresh" KnobOnly
knob Ratio              "Ratio" KnobOnly
knob Attack             "Atk" KnobOnly
knob Release            "Rel" KnobOnly
knob Knee               "Knee" KnobOnly
knob Makeup             "Mkup" KnobOnly
knob Mix                "Mix" KnobOnly

